==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|flatering}}, {{m|enm|flatrung|pos=gerund}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|flatter|ing}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|flă'tərĭng}}, {{IPA|/ˈflætəɹɪŋ/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-flattering.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# attractive or good-looking; that makes one look good
#: {{ux|en|The dress really did not look very '''flattering''' on her figure.}}
#: {{syn|en|becoming}}
#: {{ant|en|unbecoming|unflattering}}

